{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2019-11-07 22:30:00', 'title': 'WABTEC WINS DRILL MOTOR DEAL WITH MEGHA ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED', 'text': "WABTEC AND MEGHA ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT FOR 143 AC DRILL MOTORS TO SUPPORT AN UPCOMING ONSHORE RIG REPLACEMENT PROJECT FOR OIL AND NATURAL GAS CORPORATION. THE DEAL WILL SUPPORT ONGC IN ITS EFFORTS TO REPLACE THEIR AGING FLEET OF ONSHORE DRILLING RIGS. MEIL IS LEADING THE PROJECT TO REPLACE NEARLY HALF OF ONGC'S AGING 67 ONSHORE DRILLING RIGS. THE UPGRADE IS A CRITICAL INFRASTRUCTURE INITIATIVE TO INCREASE CRUDE OIL PRODUCTION AS PART OF ONCG'S GROWTH STRATEGY OUTLINED IN PERSPECTIVE PLAN 2030. THE NEW DRILL MOTORS WILL GIVE THE ONSHORE RIGS, BEING MADE BY DRILLMEC, THE DRILLING POWER NECESSARY TO RAISE PRODUCTION LEVELS."}{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2019-11-07 22:30:00', 'title': 'WABTEC WINS DRILL MOTOR DEAL WITH MEGHA ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED', 'text': "WABTEC AND MEGHA ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT FOR 143 AC DRILL MOTORS TO SUPPORT AN UPCOMING ONSHORE RIG REPLACEMENT PROJECT FOR OIL AND NATURAL GAS CORPORATION. THE DEAL WILL SUPPORT ONGC IN ITS EFFORTS TO REPLACE THEIR AGING FLEET OF ONSHORE DRILLING RIGS. MEIL IS LEADING THE PROJECT TO REPLACE NEARLY HALF OF ONGC'S AGING 67 ONSHORE DRILLING RIGS. THE UPGRADE IS A CRITICAL INFRASTRUCTURE INITIATIVE TO INCREASE CRUDE OIL PRODUCTION AS PART OF ONCG'S GROWTH STRATEGY OUTLINED IN PERSPECTIVE PLAN 2030. THE NEW DRILL MOTORS WILL GIVE THE ONSHORE RIGS, BEING MADE BY DRILLMEC, THE DRILLING POWER NECESSARY TO RAISE PRODUCTION LEVELS."}{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2019-11-07 22:30:00', 'title': 'WABTEC WINS DRILL MOTOR DEAL WITH MEGHA ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED', 'text': "WABTEC AND MEGHA ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT FOR 143 AC DRILL MOTORS TO SUPPORT AN UPCOMING ONSHORE RIG REPLACEMENT PROJECT FOR OIL AND NATURAL GAS CORPORATION. THE DEAL WILL SUPPORT ONGC IN ITS EFFORTS 